        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>When you allow an apparition control over your body, it might vent its fury against your foes. When you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Relinquish Control], you add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reposition], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove], and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trip] to the list of actions you can take. You gain a +2 status bonus to the Athletics check to attempt these actions.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Relinquish Control"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
