          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Wings free you from the shackles of the ground below. You add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Aerial Form] to your apparition spell repertoire, allowing you to cast it with your apparition spellcasting. Whenever you use <em>aerial form</em> to gain a form that grants you a specific Acrobatics modifier, you gain a +1 status bonus to Acrobatics checks.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you are attuned to an apparition of darkened boughs, add the bat and bird forms in <em>aerial form</em> to your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkened Forest Form] lists.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
